Subject: [PATCH 02674/11362] [outer-loop] Qwen3.5-9B-MTP: 1.4-2x MTP speedup
 (13 tok/s), grounding held -- operator-selected generator

Operator selected Qwen3.5-9B + the MTP variant (unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-MTP-GGUF, 5.9GB). llama.cpp native
--spec-type draft-mtp: 67-75% draft acceptance -> ka59 8.18->11.53 tok/s (1.41x, still grounds Tier2),
tn36 6.66->13.02 tok/s (1.95x). Fastest AR model tested (~13 tok/s, ~3x gemma) at the smallest footprint.
Self-MTP loads the model twice (~11GB) -> ~5GB KV on 16GB (~78k tok @ q8); keep MTP a deploy flag.
Harness now supports --mtp + model registry incl. qwen3.5-9b-mtp.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
